# ==========================================================================
# Personal data & secrets — NEVER commit these.
# ==========================================================================

# SQLite backup mirrors of localStorage: contain the live calendar proxy token,
# the Apps Script deployment URL, secret ICS feed URLs, and all personal data.
*.db

# JSON data exports: proxy token is nulled, but these still hold secret ICS feed
# URLs and all personal app data (websites, to-dos, pomodoro history).
anderson-homepage-backup-*.json

# Claude Code tooling & local settings. settings.json currently embeds a secret
# ICS feed URL in its permission allowlist, and both settings files hold
# machine-specific absolute paths.
.claude/

# Claude token-usage snapshot written by tools/update-claude-usage.ps1 for the
# header widget (percentages/reset times only, but machine-generated).
/usage-data.js
/usage-data.js.tmp

# Live Claude Code session status written by tools/claude-status-hook.js for the
# project status bar (session ids, project dirs, states, agent types —
# machine-generated). Since v4.15 it ALSO holds one line of user text per
# session: a <=64-char snippet of that conversation's first prompt, used as its
# label. Treat this file as sensitive — never commit it, and don't paste it.
/claude-projects.js
/claude-projects.tmp-*.js

# ==========================================================================
# Machine-specific / OS cruft
# ==========================================================================
*.lnk
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
._*

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Dependencies / temp (none used today, but guard against future tooling)
node_modules/
*.log
/approve-token.json
